/*/{Protheus.doc} PCPA156
Rotina de entrada para abrir o app de acompanhamento de pedidos.

@type function
@author karina.lmiranda
@since 27/07/2026
/*/
Function PCPA156()

    If PCPVldApp()
        P156CallApp()
    EndIf

Return Nil

/*/{Protheus.doc} PCPA156Interface
Classe de interface do app de acompanhamento de pedidos.

@author Lucas Fagundes
@since 26/08/2026
@version P12
/*/
Class PCPA156Interface

    static method processJsToAdvpl(oWebChannel as object, cType as character, cContent as character) as logical

EndClass

/*/{Protheus.doc} processJsToAdvpl
Processo as chamadas da tela.

@author Lucas Fagundes
@since 26/08/2026
@version P12
@param oWebChannel, Object, Instancia da classe TWebEngine.
@param cType, Character, Parâmetro de tipo.
@param cContent, Character, Conteúdo enviado pela tela.
@return .T.
/*/
Method processJsToAdvpl(oWebChannel as object, cType as character, cContent as character) as logical class PCPA156Interface

Return .T.
